<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHP" style="id">- Dũya Translation Project</book>
  <para style="h">Ufirhibi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ubvur Uburhu aka atsɛnge abi Ufirhibi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ufirhibi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ufrb</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ubvur Uburhu aka atsɛnge abi</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ufirhibi</para>
  <para style="imt">Utsutson ri itsi ubvur Ufirhibi</para>
  <para style="ip">Uburhu uner itser Uyesu unga atsɛng ubvur uwurɛ. Iwu ugɛɛ unga atsɛng umgbɔ ra amɛk aki 57-59 use 61 udzur ru unumkpi umbɔ aka amar Uyesu. Uburhu atsɛng ubvur uwurɛ ri ivangyɛ unga aka awe ru ugbor uzĩ. Unga atsɛnge abika adɔsa abi inggbaashia unga aka adzin ru Umakidoniya.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ubin hã uku utsu umbɔ atsɛng ubvur uwurɛ, atsɛng atar uwɛɛ ra abika adɔsa ru uteu Ufirhibi ri itsi iyiyike iyi ízũwã nu ifɛn-Num hã umbɔ aka akorhe ri ivangyɛ Uburhu aka awe ra ayetnum.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ubvur ha udɛyiwa umɛn ugɛ abɔɔ ani idũwũ Isarhe Iyiki Ize na akpɛ̃mbɔ igbopi itsi nggu Uburhu, bɔr rimi hã, Uburhu awe ra anggɔm ugɛ, &lt;&lt; ... Ubinkpi uku uwe ru ugarh kishoo uwe ugɛ adzowe isarhe Ukiristo.&gt;&gt; Ikɛi udɛyiwe ighongamɛn ri itsi imesi igbɛrangwĩ iki isoyi ra abika adɔsa ru Ufirhibi, ikpũ ipipare ha umbɔ aka apara anera ugɛ awu ufang umbɔ adɔsu imesa iyi Umusa na adɔrha akpo ififɔrh. Ubvur ha ufituwe imangmang abi Ufirhibi ugɛ umbɔ amesi iwe ru idɔngamɛn nu irhɛrhi itsi ikpũ iyi Uyesu nu ikpũ ibibima Uburhu aka akorhe, na awu abika agɔm anggɔm ubɛn ivang.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ri imimasha, ubvur ha idzowe umbɔ itsũwã ugɛ umbɔ asei isei iyiki ize nggu adɔkambɔ.</para>
  <para style="iot">Abinkɛ aka awe umɔ</para>
  <para style="io1">Utsutson ri itsi ubvur ha <char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHP 1:1-11">1.1-11</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Agben ibibɛk ru Uburhu <char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHP 1:12-26">1.12-26</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ibibɛk ru ubok Ukiristo <char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHP 1:27-2:18">1.27—2.18</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Utimoti nu Uabaforiditu <char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHP 2:19-30">2.19-30</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ififita nu igbiir ato ri itsi abi imesi igbɛrangwĩ <char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHP 3:1-4:9">3.1—4.9</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Imimasha <char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHP 4:10-23">4.10-23</ref>)</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHP 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 1:1"/>Ubvur uwirɛ udzeku Uburhu nu Utimoti. Umɛn iwe agãrhũ Ukiristo Uyesu. Umɛn itsɛnge kishoo aner Unum abika adɔsu Ukiristo Uyesu ru uteu Ufirhipi. Umɛn ikɛi itsɛnge anggbaashimbɔ nu adikin.<verse eid="PHP 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 1:2"/>Unum Utɛmɛn nu Uteijee Uyesu Ukiristo ama adzaa umbi imimuta nu ididɔɔr.<verse eid="PHP 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Itarwɛɛ nu ifɛn-Num</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 1:3"/>Umum, Uburhu, itar uwɛɛ ru Unummum ubɛn ivang umum iki ikaifɛrhkɔ umbi. <verse eid="PHP 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 1:4"/>Ubɛn ivang umum ifɛna-Num ru umbi kishoo, umum ifɛn nggu anggɔm akarhãrhã, <verse eid="PHP 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 1:5"/>ubinkutsu umbi aka atɔ̃mbi itser nggu umum ri idɛyiwe anera Isarhe Iyiki Ize ha. Umbi aka akorhumbi akɛrɛ utirhi ru unumkpi umbi aka awe ru imangmang uba utsĩ icɛrɛ. <verse eid="PHP 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 1:6"/>Idzidzɛrhe umum ihwɛng ugɛ Unum aka atirhunga ikorhe iyiki ize ra amɛnmbi. Nu unga awuri inua ikorha ngge utsɛku unga aka imasha kishoo ivangyɛ Ukiristo Uyesu aka ibvui aba.<verse eid="PHP 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 1:7"/>Irhikungge umum igũ ri iminɛ ri itsimbi kishoo, ngge iki iwe ugɛ umum ĩbema umbi nggu kishoo amɛnmum. Uko umum iwe ru ugborzĩ use ikake Isarhe Iyiki Ize ni ĩdɛyiwe ugɛ iwe idzidzɛrhe, kishoo umbi agasha nggu umum ri imimuta iyi Unum. <verse eid="PHP 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 1:8"/>Unum awu idekamum ugɛ umum ĩbeemum umbi kishoo akarhãrhã nggu ibibemayɛ Ukiristo Uyesu aka adzaa umum.<verse eid="PHP 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 1:9"/>Umum ifɛn-Num ugɛ umbi awuri itoma abemumbi adɔka na aseng ri ihwihwɛngmbi na adɛ̃ɛ̃ atsũ ri iyiki irhika nu iyiki ida irhika. <verse eid="PHP 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 1:10"/>Umbi aba akorhumbi rimi, umbi awuri idɛ̃ɛ̃ atsũmbi ubinkpi uku uwe uku uze. Umbi ikɛi awuri idɛ̃ɛ̃ aseimbi isei iyiki isar iki ishingge ru uvau utsɛku Ukiristo aka ibvui aba. <verse eid="PHP 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 1:11"/>Umbi ikɛi awuri idɛ̃ɛ̃ akorhumbi abin aka arhika arhɛrhɛ ri ijee Uyesu Ukiristo iki uwuri ikũ ikpikpoi nu itosa iba ru Unum.<verse eid="PHP 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uburhu aka awe ru ugborzĩ <optbreak/> itsu Isarhe Iyiki Ize izɛ̃rhã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 1:12"/>Umbi angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn, umum ibee umbi ahwɛng ugɛ abin aka abewe ha aka akorhe ru umum atsu Isarhe Iyiki Ize ha izɛ̃rhã. <verse eid="PHP 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 1:13"/>Icɛrɛ kishoo abi iwa aki idzɛu udzepurhe uyɛrhe nu kishoo abɔɔ nggimi aka ahwɛngmbɔ ugɛ umum iwe ru ugborzĩ ri itsi idzowe isarhe Ukiristo. <verse eid="PHP 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 1:14"/>Ri itsi umum iki iwe ru ugborzĩ, Uteijee atsu irhɛ abika adɔsa nggimi awe ru ikeramɛn. Umbɔ ani irherha Arherhu-Num nggu ikeramɛn akarhãrhã nu isheri iwei.<verse eid="PHP 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 1:15"/>Awu idzidzɛrhe ugɛ abɔɔ adzowe isarhe Ukiristo umbɔ agũ unyɛ̃ɛ̃ umum na abee abɔɔ anyã umbɔ awe ru ugarh anangmbɔ umum. Bɔr abɔɔ adzowe isarhe Ukiristo ra amɛn aka aze<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nggu ikeramɛn na aminasu akpo ugarha idɛyiwe abɔɔ arherhe ha izũwã.</char></note> <verse eid="PHP 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 1:16"/>nu ibibema. Umbɔ ahwɛngmbɔ ugɛ atsuka umum ru ugborzĩ ngge itsú umum idɛyiwe anera ugɛ Isarhe Iyiki Ize iwe idzidzɛrhe. <verse eid="PHP 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 1:17"/>Abɔɔ adzowe isarhe Ukiristo ngge itsú umbɔ akpo ubin umbɔ aka abee. Umbɔ asi idzowekumbɔ ngge nggu amɛn aka asar. Umbɔ akaifɛrhkɔ ugɛ idzowe isarhembɔ iwuri itsu ighongamɛn ru umum ri ivangyɛ umum iki iwe ru ugborzĩ. <verse eid="PHP 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 1:18"/>Bɔr ubinkpi umbɔ aka akaifɛrhkɔ usi ighongkpɔ amɛnmum. Umbɔ aba akorha ngge ri ifɛrhkɔ iyiki ibewe use ifɛrhkɔ iyiki ize, ubinkpi uku uwe ru ugarh kishoo uwe ugɛ adzowe isarhe Ukiristo. Ake atsu umum inggɔmanggɔm.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHP 1:18">Ĩĩ umum iwuri inggɔmanggɔm, <verse eid="PHP 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 1:19"/>umum ihwɛng ugɛ ru ubok ifɛn-Nummbi nu iyiyikeyɛ iki idzeki Ipfu Uyesu Ukiristo, umum iwuri idze ru ugborzĩ ukpirɛ. <verse eid="PHP 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 1:20"/>Umum ifosa akarhãrhã ugɛ umum isi ígũmum atsak ru ubinkpi umum iki ikorhe. Umum ibee irherhe ni isheri iwei ngge itsú umum idɛ̃ɛ̃ ikũ ikpikpoi iba ru Ukiristo ri ikikorhamum, ru nyaka ha umum iki iwe ubɛn ivang. Umum ĩba ĩbɛk use ĩba ikpe, umum ibee ikpoi unga ubɛn ivang. <verse eid="PHP 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 1:21"/>Umum ĩba ibɛk, umum ikpoi Ukiristo ukpekũ, ikɛi ivangyɛ umum iki ikpe, iwuri iwe ru ugarh inangge ibibɛk ru upfung! <verse eid="PHP 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 1:22"/>Umum ĩba inu ibɛk ri iyor iyɛrɛ, umum idɛ̃ɛ̃ ikorhumum ubinkpi uku awe ru ugarh. Bɔr umum iwuri itsũ ubin ukusong? Umum isi ihwɛng! <verse eid="PHP 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 1:23"/>Umum isi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ itsũmum akpe use ibibɛk. Umum ibee ineke upfung ukpirɛ ni iwe nggu Ukiristo, ubinkutsu, ngge iwe iyiki izea ru umum. <verse eid="PHP 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 1:24"/>Bɔr izengge ru umbi umum ĩba ĩbɛk ri iyormum.<verse eid="PHP 1:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 1:25"/>Umum ihwɛng izengge ru umbi, nggee umum ihwɛngmum iwuri iwe ru urhɛ nu umum iwuri inu itsermum ru umbi kishoo. Umum ibee iyika umbi atoma awe ru imangmang ru Unum na awe ra anggɔm ra ake. <verse eid="PHP 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 1:26"/>Ngge itsú ivangyɛ umum iki iwe nggu umbi ikɛi umbi awuri itoma akpoi Ukiristo Uyesu ru ubinkpi unga aka akorhe ru ubokmum.<verse eid="PHP 1:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ibibɛkyɛ iki imɛ̃ Isarhe Iyiki Ize</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 1:27"/>Ubinkpi uku unang kishoo, ugɛ umbi akorhe ru utsĩndĩwi uku urhika ra abika awe ru imangmang ri Isarhe Iyiki Ize ri itsi Ukiristo. Mɔcɛ umum ĩba iba inyã umbi use igũ arherhe ri itsimbi, umum iwuri ihwɛng ugɛ umbi adɛ̃ɛ̃ akermbi urhɔnga na ani itɔ̃ itser akarhãrhã ri ikake abin hã Isarhe Iyiki ize iki imesuwe. <verse eid="PHP 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 1:28"/>Ikɛi umbi asi ígũmbi iwei ru ubɛn utsĩndĩ abika akpɛ̃na umbi. Ri ikorhe ru nyaka ha umbi awuri idɛyiwe umbɔ ugɛ Unum awuri itsĩme umbɔ, bɔr awuri ifɔrha umbi. <verse eid="PHP 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 1:29"/>Umum irherha akɛrɛ ubinkutsu Unum aka adɛyiwanga umbi imimuta ri ineka umbi awe ru imangmang ru Ukiristo nu ikɛi ahwa ayetnum ru unga. <verse eid="PHP 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 1:30"/>Ayetnum hã icɛrɛ umbi aka awe ra ake, awe ru nyaka ayetnumkɛ umbi aka anyã umum ra ake, nu ayetnumkɛ umbi aka agũ icɛrɛ umum ini iwe ra ake.<verse eid="PHP 1:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PHP 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Àka arhɛrhitsi ru nyaku Ukiristo <optbreak/> aka arhɛrhi itsinga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 2:1"/>Umbi aba afita ri itsimbi aka awe abi Ukiristo, nu umbi aba awembi ri idɔngamɛn ru ibibemanga ru umbi, nu umbi aba awembi ri iwɛrha nggu Ipfu-Num, nu Ukiristo aba awea ri inna nu icicorhe ru umbi, <verse eid="PHP 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 2:2"/>mɔcɛ àka atsu umum igɔmagɔm idzidzɛrhe ri idɔsa arherhamum. Umbi àka akaifɛrhkɔ abin urhɔnga. Àka abema adɔka. Àka awe amɛn unying nggu adɔka na azĩ ra asu urhɔnga. <verse eid="PHP 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 2:3"/>Àka niba akorhumbi ifɛrhɛyɛ iki itsu umbi awe ru ugarh anangmbi abɔɔ use akorhe ubinkpi uku utsu umbi aberi itsi. Bɔr àka irhɛrhi atsimbi àka aneke ubɛn unera anyangu uner uwɔɔ ananga unga. <verse eid="PHP 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 2:4"/>Umbi kishoo àka niba akaifɛrhkɔ na akorha abinkɛ aka iyika umbi ukpekũ, bɔr àka akorha abin aka aze àka iyike abɔɔ.<verse eid="PHP 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 2:5"/>Imɛ̃ngge umbi akaifɛrhkɔ ru nyaku Ukiristo Uyesu.<verse eid="PHP 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 2:6"/>Unga awe ru nyaku Unum ru ubɛn utsĩndĩã,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:6">bɔr asi inyangi itsinga awea icaica nggu Unum.<verse eid="PHP 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 2:7"/>Unga anyangi itsinga asi iwea ubin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:7">unga awe ugãrhã ri adzeka ri iyor uner.<verse eid="PHP 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 2:8"/>Unga aka adzipa awe unera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:8">unga arhɛrhi itsinga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:8">na akpe ru nyaka Unum aka adɛyiwe unga.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:8">Unga akpe ru utsĩndĩ uwuku ubewe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:8">ri inyapuwe unga ru igãrhãmau ucucii!<verse eid="PHP 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 2:9"/>Ngge itsu Unum abera unga afafã</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:9">ra anangkɛ aka anangke ubɛn anang</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:9">na adzowe unga itsokɛ iki inangke ubɛn itsok.<verse eid="PHP 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 2:10"/>Unum akorha akɛrɛ ngge itsú ubɛn unera ra afã nu abĩ use unɔrkang abĩ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:10">awuri itar arhu ri idzowe itsi ru Uyesu,<verse eid="PHP 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 2:11"/>nu ubɛn arhɛm awuri irherhe ukupɛ̃ɛ̃</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:11">ugɛ Uyesu Ukiristo awu Uteijee.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:11">Akɛrɛ awuri ikũ imor azĩ ru Unum Utɛ.<verse eid="PHP 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Irhang ru nyaki idzɛɛr</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 2:12"/>A aze awɛrhamum, rimi hã, aka adɔsa ru nyaka umbi aka isaka adɔsa ri ivangyɛ umum iki ina iwe nggu umbi, àka adɛ̃ɛ̃ adɔsa na akorhe icɛrɛ anangmbi umum iki isi iwemum nggu umbi. Àka atɔ̃ itser adɛyiwe ififɔrhmbi nggu iwei nu izizang. <verse eid="PHP 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 2:13"/>Umbi adɛ̃ɛ̃ akorhumbi akɛrɛ ubinkutsu Unum nibikanga anu itɔ̃ itser ru umbi ri iyika umbi abema na akorhe ubinkpi unga aka abee umbi akorhe.<verse eid="PHP 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 2:14"/>Àka niba akorhumbi ifɛrhɛ ri ibvibvun use uning, <verse eid="PHP 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 2:15"/>ngge itsú unera asi írhenunga umbi ri ikorhe iki ibewe, nu umbi awuri iwe asasar. Umbi awuri iwe angwɛ̃ Unum aka asi íkorhumbɔ ubin uvau ra ateu abi amɛn aka atãrhã, umbɔ aka isaka akorhe abin aka abewe. Awu ufang umbi asei isei iyiki ize nggu umbɔ ru nyaka abika arhang ugɛɛ ídzɛɛr ra afafã. <verse eid="PHP 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 2:16"/>Aka adɛ̃ɛ̃ aker ri isarhe idzidzɛrhe iyiki idzowe urhɛ. Mɔcɛ, ru unumkpi Ukiristo aka iba, ngge iwuri itsu umum ifĩrhã ugɛ umum isi itɔ̃mum itser iyiki itso ru umbi ibɛm. <verse eid="PHP 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 2:17"/>Abinkɛ umbi aka adzowe na akorhe aki idze ru imangmangmbi ru Uyesu awe ru nyaki idɛm-Num. Uko urhɛmum uba uwe ru nyaku ungwɛ̃rhã abin aka ahwakɛ umbɔ aka awupuwe izũwã ru idɛm-Num, umum iwe ra anggɔm nggu umbi kishoo. <verse eid="PHP 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 2:18"/>Umbi igambi aka agɔm anggɔm nggu umum.<verse eid="PHP 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Utimoti nu Uabaforiditu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 2:19"/>Umum ifosa ugɛ Uteijee Uyesu abemuwa umum idene Utimoti aba ru umbi ifitem, ngge itsú umum ima igɔmagɔm ivangyɛ umum iki igũ isarhe ra atsimbi. <verse eid="PHP 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 2:20"/>Umum ishimum nu uwɔɔ nggu umum ru nyaku Utimoti. Awu idzidzɛrhe unga abee inyã iker iyormbi. <verse eid="PHP 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 2:21"/>Abɔɔ nggimi akpurha akaifɛrhkɔ abinkɛ umbɔ aka abee na asi ikambɔ ifɛrhkɔ abinkɛ Uyesu Ukiristo aka abee. <verse eid="PHP 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 2:22"/>Bɔr umbi ahwɛngmbi agɛ Utimoti aka adɛyiwanga iwiwenga. Unga atɔ̃ itser urhɔnga nggu umum adzowe Isarhe Iyiki Ize ru nyaku ungwɛ̃ aki itɔ̃ itser nggu utɛnga. <verse eid="PHP 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 2:23"/>Nggee uba umum igũmum abinkɛ abi ijee Uroma aka ikorhuwa umum, umum iwuri idene unga aba ru umbi. <verse eid="PHP 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 2:24"/>Nu umum iwemum ri ikeramɛn ugɛ Uteijee awuri ineka umum iba ru umbi ifitem.<verse eid="PHP 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 2:25"/>Bɔr umum ikaifɛrhkɔ ugɛ awu ufang umum idene Uabaforiditu abvui aba ru umbi. Unga awu ungwɛ̃mɛn. Unga atɔ̃ itser nggu umum na atang iwa ru nyaku uner iwa nggu umum ri idzowe Isarhe Iyiki Ize. Umbi adene unga ru umum ru unga ayika umum nggu ubinkpi umum iki ibee. <verse eid="PHP 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 2:26"/>Umum ibee idene unga aba ru umbi ubinkutsu umbi agũmbi ugɛ aghonga unga, amɛnnga adake. Ngge itsu unga adzuma abee inyã umbi. <verse eid="PHP 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 2:27"/>Idzidzɛrhe irhãrhã ighongge unga akpurha abɔr akpe. Bɔr Unum acorhuwe unga nu umum ikɛi. Unum asi ibeenga umum itoma nggu idɔngamɛn ri idɔng amɛnyɛ umum iki iwerangge. <verse eid="PHP 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 2:28"/>Umum itoma ibee idene unga aba, nggee umbi aba anyãmbi unga ikɛi, umbi ama agɔm nu umum ima itsuwe ighongamɛnmum. <verse eid="PHP 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 2:29"/>Mɔcɛ aka ayɛi unga nggu ibibema iyi Uteijee nggu anggɔm na adzowe imor ra anera ru nyaka unga. <verse eid="PHP 2:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 2:30"/>Àka akorha akɛrɛ ubinkutsu unga akpurha abɔr akpe ri itser Ukiristo. Unga atsu itsinga ru iyiki ighong ri iyika umum ivangyɛ umbi aka asi idɛ̃ɛ̃ ayikambi umum.<verse eid="PHP 2:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PHP 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Unum anyã umbi ru nyaka abika asusar ru ubok imangmang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 3:1"/>Arherha akɔɔ akɛ umum iki ibee irherhe. Umbi angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn, aka agɔm anggɔm ugɛ umbi awe abi Uteijee! Asi íwea ighighong ru umum itsɛnga abin ru umbi akirakɛ umum iki ititi itsɛnga umbi. Ngge iwuri ika umbi ri imangmangmbi.<verse eid="PHP 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 3:2"/>Niba uneke aner ha aki ikorhe ru nyaki íjui akũna umbi ayapumbɔ. Umbɔ akorhe iyiki ibewe ivangyɛ umbɔ iki ibee usorhe uwe utsar ififɔrh, umbɔ akpurha azharhuwe agau ayormbɔ. <verse eid="PHP 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 3:3"/>Umɛn iwe ru usorhe idzidzɛrhe ukpu ipfu, ubinkutsu umɛn idzowe igɔng ru Unum ri Ipfunga, umɛn iwe ru ikeramɛn ru Uyesu Ukiristo, umɛn isi iwemɛn ru ikeramɛn ugɛ ititɛ̃wãmɛn iwuri ifɔrh umɛn. <verse eid="PHP 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 3:4"/>Bɔr umum iwemum nu ubinkpi uku utsu umum ikeramɛn.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHP 3:4">Unera aba akaifɛrhkɔ ugɛ ititɛ̃wãnga iwuri ifɔrh unga, mɔcɛ unga ahwɛng ugɛ umum itɛ̃wã inang unga. <verse eid="PHP 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 3:5"/>Asorhuwa umum ru unum ukpu utɔrɔk. Umum iwu uner Uisrairha. Umum iwe ru unang Ubanjami. Umum iwu utsa Uyahuda. Uyamum nu utɛmum awu abi Uyahuda. Umum iwe Ufarisi abika adɔsi Íkpem anangmbɔ ubɛn unera. <verse eid="PHP 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 3:6"/>Umum ĩdɛyiwe itsu amɛnmum ru Unum ri idzowe uver ra abika adɔsu Uyesu. Umum inyangu itsimum irhika ru utsĩndĩwi umum iki udɔsi Íkpem.<verse eid="PHP 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 3:7"/>Bɔr kishoo abinkɛ umum iki ikaifɛrhkɔ ugɛ awu ake atsu umum iwe asasar ra asu Unum, icɛrɛ umum inyã ake asi iweke ubin, ri itsi umum iki iwe ru imangmang ru Ukiristo. <verse eid="PHP 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 3:8"/>Abinkɛ aka anang, umum irhi ubɛn ubin ugɛɛ usi imɛ̃kpɔ ivangyɛ umum iki ikpanga ukpɔ nggu nggaa ugarhkpi ukpuku uhwɛng Ukiristo Uyesu Uteijeemum. Umum iki itarukũ kishoo ubɛn ubinmum ri itsinga. Umum irhi abina ru nyaka abinkɛ aka ashike ru ugarh ru umum ima ikpo Ukiristo, <verse eid="PHP 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 3:9"/>ni ikpo iwe uwu unga. Unum asi inyanga umum iwemum uner uwuku urhika ri idɔsi Íkpem. Bɔr unga anyanga umum uner uwuku urhika ri iwe ru imangmang ru Ukiristo. Irhirhika ha idzeku Unum ru ubok imangmang. <verse eid="PHP 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 3:10"/>Umum ibee ihwɛng Ukiristo nu ijee iyiki isoknga ra akpe nu igasha ra ayetnumnga, ni iwe ru nyaka unga ra akpenga. <verse eid="PHP 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 3:11"/>Ngge itsú umum ima isok ra akpe ikɛi.<verse eid="PHP 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Igɔpa izĩ ra asu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 3:12"/>Isi iwengge ugɛ umum iki ikpomum akɛrɛ kishoo, umum inasi iwemum ru nyaka Ukiristo, bɔr umum ikpurhi itsu amɛnmum ibee iwe ru nyaku Ukiristo, aki ha atsu Uyesu akpɔm umum. <verse eid="PHP 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 3:13"/>Umbi angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn, umum isi ikakũ ifɛrhkɔ ugɛ umum iki idzur ikpɔmmum ukpɔ, bɔr umum ikorhu ubina unying. Umum iyiruwe ubinkpi uku utɔngkpɔ ra andzing nu itɔ̃ itser akarhãrhã igɔpa izĩ ra asu ru ubinkpi uku uwuri ikorhe. <verse eid="PHP 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 3:14"/>Umum igɔpa nggu ikermum izĩ ra asu ru ubinkpi uku udzɛu umum ri imimasha. Umum ikorhe rimi ngge itsú umum iyɛi ugbɛtɛ Unum aka ayisa umum ra afã izĩ iyɛi, ru ubok ubinkpi Ukiristo Uyesu aka akorhe.<verse eid="PHP 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 3:15"/>Kishookamɛn iki iseng ri imangmang, imɛ̃ngge umɛn irhi abina ru utsĩndĩ uwɛrɛ. Nu unermbi unying aba akaifɛrhkɔ iyikise ru ubina unying ra abin hã umum iki irherhe, mɔcɛ Unum awuri iyikuka unga anyã ru utsĩndĩ uwuku urhika ikɛi. <verse eid="PHP 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 3:16"/>Bɔr umɛn ima isisei ru nyaka abinkɛ umɛn iki imesa uba utsĩ icɛrɛ.<verse eid="PHP 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 3:17"/>Umbi angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn, àka agbopa nggu abɔɔ ri ikorhe ru nyaka umum. Àka arhi abirabɛ aka abɛk ru nyaka abinkɛ umɛn iki ĩdzaa umbi. <verse eid="PHP 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 3:18"/>Ubinkutsu anera arhɛrhɛ abɛk ru nyaka anggamtsak igãrhãmau ucucii Ukiristo. Umum iki idɛyiwamum akɛrɛ isha, nu icɛrɛ umum irherhe ake ikɛi nggu anyĩ. <verse eid="PHP 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 3:19"/>Ivangyɛ umbɔ aka ikpe, umbɔ awuri itsĩ ri itsitsĩm. Unummbɔ awu anambɔ. Abinkɛ umbɔ aka agɔm awu abin ishĩ umbɔ aki ikorhe. Amɛnmbɔ awe ra abin upfung. <verse eid="PHP 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 3:20"/>Bɔr umɛn iwe abi afã. Umɛn ini idzɛu uwuku ufɔrh umɛn Uteijee Uyesu Ukiristo, uwuruwi aka idzeku nggɔɔ ha. <verse eid="PHP 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 3:21"/>Unga awea ri ijee iyiki ikũ abina kishoo aba ri ididarhnga. Unga awuri ikũ ijee ha afaruwe ayormɛn aka aghong irhãrhã na akpe icɛrɛ ngge itsú ake awe ru nyaki iyinga iyiki ibɛk ugbagbaa.<verse eid="PHP 3:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PHP 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 4:1"/>Nggee, umbi angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn, ngge iwuri itsu umbi adɛ̃ɛ̃ aker ri idɔsu Uteijee. Umbi awe awɛrhamum iki ibema ni idzumi ibee inyã. Umbi atsu umum igɔmagɔm. Umbi awe ru nyaku nggaa itosa iyi itsermum iki itso.<verse eid="PHP 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ishishɔ̃rhũ Uburhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 4:2"/>Umum ishɔ̃rhã ungo Uafodiya nu Usintiki umbi akaifɛrhkɔ unying nggu adɔka ubinkutsu umbi awe ru imangmang ru Uteijee. <verse eid="PHP 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 4:3"/>Ĩĩ, ikɛi umum irhusa ungo uwɛrhɛ itsermum uwu idzidzɛrhe uyike akatsɛrh abɛrɛ aka atɔ̃ itser akarhãrhã ayika umum ri idzowe Isarhe Iyiki Ize. Ukirhemen nu abɔɔ aka atɔ̃ itser nggu umum ikɛi nu kishoo atsokɛ umbɔ aka atsɛng ru ubvur uwu urhɛ.<verse eid="PHP 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 4:4"/>Ubɛn ivang àka agɔm anggɔm ugɛ umbi awe abi Uteijee. Umum iwuri irherhumum ikɛi, àka agɔm anggɔm! <verse eid="PHP 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 4:5"/>Àka adɛyiwe ubɛn unera ididɔɔryɛ umbi aka awe. Uteijee asi ídãrhunga na aba. <verse eid="PHP 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 4:6"/>Niba angwãrhũmbi anaa ri itsi ubɛn ubin, bɔr àka arhusu Unum ubinkpi umbi aka abee, àka ashɔ̃rhã unga na atar uwɛɛ ru unga. <verse eid="PHP 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 4:7"/>Nu ididɔɔryɛ Unum aka adzowe, ididɔɔr ha iki inangge kishoo ihwihwɛng iwuri ikake ifɛrhkɔmbi nu ubinkpi umbi aka igũ ra amɛnmbi ubinkutsu umbi awe ru imangmang ru Ukiristo Uyesu.<verse eid="PHP 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 4:8"/>Umbi angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn, ubinkpi uku udɔsa umum iki ibee irherhe unggakpi. Àka adɛ̃ɛ̃ akaifɛrhkɔ ri itsi abinkɛ aka awe idzidzɛrhe na awe ru imor na arhika na asar ru abinkɛ aki itsu amɛn agɔm anggɔm, nu abin aka aze inyĩnyã, nu udzumu ize na amɛ̃ɛ̃ke iyɛi ikpikpoi. <verse eid="PHP 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 4:9"/>Àka akorhe kishoo abinkɛ umbi aka amesa na ayɛi na agũ na anyã ru umum. Unum uwuku udzowe ididɔɔr awuri iwe nggu umbi.<verse eid="PHP 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uburhu atar uwɛɛ ru umbɔ <optbreak/> ru iyiyikembɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 4:10"/>Umum iwe ra anggɔm akarhãrhã nggu ikpũ anggɔmkɛ Uteijee aka adzaa ubinkutsu umbi ikɛi aka adɛyiwambi umum ibibemambi. Ngge iwe idzidzɛrhe ugɛ umbi abemumbi umum ubɛn ivang, bɔr umbi asi ikpombi utsĩndĩ uwuku udɛyiwa ingge. <verse eid="PHP 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 4:11"/>Umum isi ini umum irherhe akɛrɛ ugɛ umum ibee ubin, umum iki imesumum igɔmagɔm nggu ubɛn ubinkpi uku ukpo umum. <verse eid="PHP 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 4:12"/>Umum iki imesumum ibɛk nggu ida ubin nu ibɛk nggu iwe ru ubinkpi uku unangkpɔ ubinkpi umum iki ibee. Umum iki imesumum ibima nggu ubɛn ubinkpi uku ukorhe ru umum. Umum iwe ra anggɔm ivang anaamum aka atɔk na ashike ru ubin, ivangyɛ umum iki ikpo inang ubinkpi umum iki ibee nu ivangyɛ umum iki isi ikpomum ubinkpi umum iki ibee. <verse eid="PHP 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 4:13"/>Ukiristo ani adzaa umum iker iyiki igɔmagɔm ru ubɛn ubinkpi uku ukorhe ru umum. <verse eid="PHP 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 4:14"/>Uko rimi hã, aze umbi aka ayika umum nggu ubinkpi umum iki ibee.<verse eid="PHP 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 4:15"/>Awu use anang akɛrɛ ha, ivangyɛ umum iki ibɔre Umakidoniya, abika adɔsu Uyesu abɔɔ asi iyikambɔ umum nggu uhwɛk uku utɔ̃itser Unum. Umbi ukpekũ akpurha akorha aki ha ri ivangyɛ umbi abi Ufirhibi aka awe abika afa ri idɔsi Isarhe Iyiki Ize. <verse eid="PHP 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 4:16"/>Uko ivangyɛ umum iki iwe ru Utasarhonika, umbi ayikambi umum anangmbi idiki unying ri ivangyɛ umum iki ibee. <verse eid="PHP 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 4:17"/>Umum isi irherhumum rimi ugɛ umum ibee iyɛi izũwã iyɔɔ. Bɔr umum ibee umbi akpo itosa akarhãrhã ru Unum. <verse eid="PHP 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 4:18"/>Umum iki iyɛisũ abina kishoo umbi aka adene ru ubok Uabaforiditu. Umum ikpo inang abinkɛ umum iki ibee. Iyiyikembi iwe ru nyaki idɛm iyiki iwe ru isung iyiki ize umbɔ aka adzowe ru Unum. Unga ayɛi ngge nggu anggɔm. <verse eid="PHP 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 4:19"/>Unummum awuri idzaanga umbi abina kishoo umbi aka abee ru abinkɛ unga aka awurake ubinkutsu umbi awe ru imangmang ru Ukiristo Uyesu.<verse eid="PHP 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 4:20"/>Unum Utɛmɛn ama awe ru ikpikpoi ugbagbaa nu ugbagbaa. Iwerimi.<verse eid="PHP 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Imimashi ighwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 4:21"/>Àka aghwe kishoo abika adɔsa, abirabɛ aka awe ru imangmang ru Ukiristo Uyesu. Abika adɔsa aka awe nggu umum nggimi aghwe umbi. <verse eid="PHP 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 4:22"/>Kishoo aner Unum nggimi aghwe umbi, undzumunga abika awe ru udzepurhe Ukaisar.<verse eid="PHP 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 4:23"/>Imimutu Uteijee Uyesu Ukiristo ima iwe nggu umbi kishoo. Iwerimi.<verse eid="PHP 4:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 4"/>
</usx>
